<title>BAHRAIN: Philippines President Ramos arrives in Bahrain.</title>
<headline>Philippines President Ramos arrives in Bahrain.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines President Fidel Ramos arrived in Bahrain on Monday for talks expected to focus on trade and investment with the Gulf Arab state, the official Gulf News Agency said.</p>
<p>It said Bahrain's Emir Sheikh Isa bin Sulman al-Khalifa and other senior officials greeted Ramos on his arrival from Qatar for a two-day visit.</p>
</text>
